# Generated contract docs are byte-compared against their zod source in
# tests/m8-contract-docs.test.ts; JSON.stringify always emits "\n", so these
# must stay LF in every working tree (core.autocrlf would otherwise convert
# them to CRLF on Windows checkouts and fail the freshness test).
docs/worker-openapi.json text eol=lf
docs/worker-contract.md text eol=lf
